  "keyFeatures": [
    "CRDT Last-Write-Wins (LWW) store with deterministic conflict resolution",
    "Anti-entropy gossip protocol for autonomous state convergence",
    "ACK-based reliability layer with sequence numbers and retry logic over UDP",
    "Configurable network chaos simulation (packet loss probability)",
    "Multi-master architecture — all nodes accept reads and writes simultaneously",
    "Thread-safe, mutex-locked store operations",
    "Pure Python with zero external dependencies",
    "Idempotent merge operations enabling safe replay and deduplication"
  ],
